          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Fortschritt": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Foto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Foto · Farblook": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your photo · color look"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dein Shot-Plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your shot plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Fotos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Hintergrund ist stark unscharf. Porträtmodus an, Tiefe auf ca. f/2 stellen. Mindestens 3 m Abstand zwischen Person und Hintergrund.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background is very blurry. Turn on portrait mode and set depth to about f/2. Keep at least 3 m between the person and the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Klassiker für Outfit-Fotos": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The classic for outfit shots"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der Kopf ist nah am oberen Bildrand – eng geschnitten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The head is close to the top edge – a tight crop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Füße sind ganz unten im Bild – aufpassen, dass sie nicht abgeschnitten werden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The feet are at the very bottom – make sure they don't get cut off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Knie sind angezogen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The knees are pulled up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Lichtquelle ist hinter der Person. Stell dich mit dem Rücken zur Sonne und tippe zum Belichten auf das Gesicht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The light is behind the person. Stand with your back to the sun and tap the face to expose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Person ist viel heller als der dunkle Hintergrund – typischer Blitz-Look. In der Kamera den Blitz anschalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The person is much brighter than the dark background – a typical flash look. Turn on the flash in the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Person steht genau in der Bildmitte.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The person stands right in the centre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Schulter auf der linken Bildseite ist tiefer – lass eine Schulter locker fallen, das wirkt lässig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shoulder on the left of the picture is lower – let one shoulder drop, it looks relaxed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Schulter auf der rechten Bildseite ist tiefer – lass eine Schulter locker fallen, das wirkt lässig.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shoulder on the right of the picture is lower – let one shoulder drop, it looks relaxed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Vorlage liegt über der Kamera. PinPose sagt dir, was du ändern sollst, und löst aus, sobald die Pose passt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original sits over the camera. PinPose tells you what to change and takes the shot as soon as the pose matches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direkt analysieren?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analyze it now?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Direkte Sonne": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Direct sun"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dreh deinen Körper etwa 45° von der Kamera weg – wirkt schlanker und natürlicher.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn your body about 45° away from the camera – it looks slimmer and more natural."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dreh den Kopf etwa %lld° zur Seite und schau an der Kamera vorbei.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
